<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans off in Oct 9 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans off in Oct 9 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED OCTOBER 9</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............762,300 down...1,200</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...699,600 down...4,000</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......463,500 up.....4,600</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....758,548 up.....2,230</p>
<p> Financial companies.......567,673 up.....5,002</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,340 down.....427</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,078 down.....428</p>
</text>
